  "source": "Fraction of peak: trim each watershed basin at the chosen fraction of its seed intensity. This is an intensity ratio, not a percentile; background offsets affect the result. The other three rules restrict the watershed with one threshold for the processed field or region. Hole filling and minimum-area filtering run afterward.",
